Begin3
Title:          ZDir
Version:        2.1b
Entered-date:   2019-07-09
Description:    ZDir is a tiny DOS directory lister
Summary:        ZDir is a tiny DOS directory lister. ZDir automatically determines how many columns to display, it can display a full tree, the colors are completely configurable, it works in any text mode, and it is lightning fast (written in assembly language).
Keywords:       asm, assembler, assembly, a86, dir
Author:         Chris Kirmse
Primary-site:   http://www.tipovers.org/zdir/
Alternate-site: https://github.com/ckirmse/ZDir
Platforms:      DOS
